---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me" >
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      I'm at my best when faced with a good challenge, which is why I'm drawn to the energy of hackathons, an environment where I can really push my creative limits under pressure.
      <br>
      <br>
      My primary tools of choice include:
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Figma</li>
        <li>Adobe Illustrator</li>
        <li>Adobe XD</li>
        <li>Node.js</li>
        <li>Next.js</li>
        <li>SQL</li>
        <li>Go</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Away from the screen, you'll find me either gaming, hitting the gym, or tackling my most ambitious project yet: <br>a perfect nap!</p>
  </div>
</Card>
